      "text": "Good morning, and I'm very pleased to be here with you at the 6th AI for IAA Conference, Artificial Intelligence for Information Accessibility Conference 2025. This is a conference that put people at the center of the conversation on artificial intelligence. From healthcare to do curriculum to the workplace, AI is increasingly becoming part of our everyday lives. But this growing presence also comes with responsibility. Today's focus is not just on what AI can do, but you know how it does it and for whom. It's more important now than ever to make this system understandable, trustworthy and inclusive. And today's discussion will help us explore AI, not just as a technical tool, but as something that is really affecting the way our societies and our economies work,",
